Codehash = keccak256(0xef0100 || profileTemplate)`.      Without step 3, every `emit*` reverts with `NotInitialized`.\",\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{},\"title\":\"BiviumEventEmitter\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{},\"notice\":\"Single-address registry + event sink for the Bivium lender Profile.         Each `emit*` function is gated by an EXTCODEHASH check that only         passes for EOAs delegated to the canonical Profile template via         EIP-7702. This closes the permissionless spam vector while keeping         the indexer surface to a single contract address.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/BiviumEventEmitter.sol\":\"BiviumEventEmitter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"prague\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@openzeppelin/contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":openzeppelin-contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/BiviumEventEmitter.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x57bb356b3530df5f019e6c65f9cb2c68ea8d28321538d82bcc5fb8197dd093d3\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://6c6770c0ec808df024ac45ca09ea03fe310e3db120b709c2e64004347fce6d2a\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmZgtvofer9rGpw5SodzWfkGSHYuBGTcyYGggZBV5GEmbt\"]},\"src/interfaces/IBiviumEventEmitter.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xa5b4464f45efece2d568e1ecd43a5f97a65affac921794fb2faa64a779f1cc38\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://439349be2b607d1a376294aececcf826ef62c2580190db28ca281cbb71edf1c8\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmYyT61ZASeMdjdH4rKkWifpigQJo35i9DAiiMFw4CVfuA\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.28+commit.7893614a"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"AlreadyInitialized"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"NotAProfile"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"NotInitialized"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","n